# game/case11.rpy:101
translate schinese press_aya_1_cb87760b:

    # you "Every case?"
    you "每一件案子？"

# game/case11.rpy:103
translate schinese press_aya_1_2af8e21a:

    # aya "Every single one. I printed Case 10 before it happened. That's how fast I am."
    aya "一件不落。第十案还没发生我就印好了。我就是这么快。"

# game/case11.rpy:105
translate schinese press_aya_1_b2a39c4b:

    # komachi "That's not how news works."
    komachi "新闻可不是这么做的。"

# game/case11.rpy:109
translate schinese press_aya_2_7ac318af:

    # you "Which seven defendants?"
    you "哪七名被告？"

# game/case11.rpy:110
translate schinese press_aya_2_fa3ecbfe:

    # aya "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu and Kaguya. Very quotable, all of them."
    aya "琪露诺、魔理沙、铃仙、美铃、爱丽丝、灵梦，还有辉夜。个个都很有话题性。"

# game/case11.rpy:112
translate schinese press_aya_2_187f1d7e:

    # komachi "Funny. Every one of them was found guilty."
    komachi "真巧。她们全都被判了有罪。"

# game/case11.rpy:116
translate schinese press_aya_3_6319ada3:

    # you "Did you ask anyone who was found not guilty?"
    you "你问过被判无罪的人吗？"

# game/case11.rpy:118
translate schinese press_aya_3_305f6ce1:

    # aya "Why would I? They're happy. Happy doesn't sell papers."
    aya "为什么要问？她们很满意。满意可卖不出报纸。"

# game/case11.rpy:122
translate schinese press_aya_4_bc5b3dba:

    # you "Today's edition. Printed when?"
    you "今日版。什么时候印的？"

# game/case11.rpy:123
translate schinese press_aya_4_5d138dca:

    # aya "Last week. I like to get ahead of things."
    aya "上周。我喜欢抢先一步。"

# game/case11.rpy:127
translate schinese press_aya_5_a9163391:

    # you "Seven verdicts. How many cases has this court heard?"
    you "七个判决。本庭审理过多少件案子？"

# game/case11.rpy:129
translate schinese press_aya_5_39a746a7:

    # aya "Seven! ...Seven that matter. Seven that photograph well."
    aya "七件！……要紧的七件。上镜的七件。"

# game/case11.rpy:131
translate schinese press_aya_5_4989539e:

    # komachi "The boss keeps the docket, Junior Judge. Have a look at it."
    komachi "案卷是四季大人保管的，见习法官。去看看吧。"

# game/case11.rpy:135
translate schinese press_aya_6_e4d229ff:

    # you "Every printed verdict is real. What about the ones you didn't print?"
    you "刊登的判决都是真的。那没刊登的呢？"

# game/case11.rpy:136
translate schinese press_aya_6_7afa73e7:

    # aya "Unprinted news isn't news. That's practically the first rule of journalism."
    aya "没刊登的新闻就不算新闻。这差不多是新闻业的第一条规矩。"

# game/case11.rpy:145
translate schinese case11_b9fe37e6:

    # komachi "Junior Judge. The boss can't sit today. She's the defendant."
    komachi "见习法官。今天四季大人不能坐审判席。她是被告。"

# game/case11.rpy:146
translate schinese case11_9981614b:

    # eiki "Bunbunmaru News accuses this court of convicting everyone. A judge cannot hear her own case."
    eiki "文文。新闻控告本庭给所有人定罪。法官不能审理自己的案子。"

# game/case11.rpy:147
translate schinese case11_4d6f9a74:

    # eiki "So the bench is yours again. I will sit where the defendants sit. It is educational."
    eiki "所以审判席又归你了。我坐被告席。很有教育意义。"

# game/case11.rpy:148
translate schinese case11_01ea8da9:

    # komachi "Gavel's yours, Junior Judge. Same as last time. It's still heavy."
    komachi "木槌归你了，见习法官。和上次一样。还是那么沉。"

# game/case11.rpy:152
translate schinese case11_34ebff6a:

    # you "Court is in session."
    you "现在开庭。"

# game/case11.rpy:157
translate schinese case11_79a1f4fa:

    # aya "Aya Shameimaru! Bunbunmaru News! Big fan! Mind if I take your picture? Thanks!"
    aya "射命丸文！文文。新闻！我是您的粉丝！能拍张照吗？谢谢！"

# game/case11.rpy:162
translate schinese case11_9ab5c611:

    # komachi "She talks fast, Junior Judge. Watch her statements. They won't wait for you."
    komachi "她说话很快，见习法官。盯紧她的证言。它们可不会等你。"

# game/case11.rpy:163
translate schinese case11_58896432:

    # eiki "A crowd, a headline, a photograph. None of them is a verdict. Ask what each one leaves out."
    eiki "人群、标题、照片。这些都不是判决。问问每一样漏掉了什么。"

# game/case11.rpy:177
translate schinese case11_1e8e0492:

    # aya_t "Aya Shameimaru, Bunbunmaru News. Fastest reporter in Gensokyo. I've covered every case in this court."
    aya_t "射命丸文，文文。新闻。幻想乡最快的记者。本庭的每一件案子我都报道过。"

# game/case11.rpy:178
translate schinese case11_4204a91b:

    # aya_t "I interviewed seven of your defendants. Every one of them says this court is unfair."
    aya_t "我采访了你们的七名被告。每个人都说本庭不公平。"

# game/case11.rpy:179
translate schinese case11_cc97f9bf:

    # aya_t "Seven defendants can't all be wrong. The Higan Court is unfair."
    aya_t "七名被告不可能都错。彼岸法庭不公平。"

# game/case11.rpy:194
translate schinese case11_cross_d2ba430c:

    # komachi "Deep breath, Junior Judge. She talks fast. You don't have to."
    komachi "深呼吸，见习法官。她说话快，你不必跟着快。"

# game/case11.rpy:199
translate schinese case11_cross_98f3d122:

    # you "How many defendants complain doesn't make a verdict unfair. And every one you asked was found guilty."
    you "抱怨的被告再多，也不能让判决变得不公。而且你问的每个人都被判了有罪。"

# game/case11.rpy:201
translate schinese case11_cross_b479d266:

    # komachi "Bandwagon. Sustained. ...I've always wanted to say that."
    komachi "从众谬误。反对有效。……我一直想说这句。"

# game/case11.rpy:205
translate schinese case11_cross_a5ee42c9:

    # aya "Fine! Forget the interviews. I have something better. The verdicts themselves."
    aya "好吧！忘掉采访吧。我有更好的东西。判决本身。"

# game/case11.rpy:206
translate schinese case11_cross_e62c874a:

    # aya "Front page. Printed and everything. I just need a moment to fetch it."
    aya "头版。已经印好了。给我一点时间去拿。"

# game/case11.rpy:208
translate schinese case11_cross_8184b6b7:

    # komachi "Court will take a short recess!"
    komachi "本庭暂时休庭！"

# game/case11.rpy:233
translate schinese case11_recess_6f90b59a:

    # eiki "A defendant may not investigate her own case, Junior Judge. But a bailiff may run errands."
    eiki "被告不能调查自己的案子，见习法官。但法警可以跑腿。"

# game/case11.rpy:234
translate schinese case11_recess_e779b85b:

    # komachi "Where to, Junior Judge? I'm fast when I want to be. I almost never want to be."
    komachi "去哪儿，见习法官？我想快的时候是很快的。只是我几乎从不想快。"

# game/case11.rpy:244
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_d9f7121b:

    # komachi "Back. Her desk is a mess. But look: her film roll."
    komachi "回来了。她的桌子乱糟糟的。不过看：她的胶卷。"

# game/case11.rpy:246
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_f0b43479:

    # komachi "Thirty-six photos on this roll, Junior Judge. She printed seven."
    komachi "这卷胶卷上有三十六张照片，见习法官。她印了七张。"

# game/case11.rpy:247
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_48f32308:

    # komachi "And this was in her props cupboard."
    komachi "还有，这个在她的道具柜里。"

# game/case11.rpy:249
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_5a7095f6:

    # eiki "The mistress's parasol. Case 06 is not as closed as I thought."
    eiki "大小姐的阳伞。看来第六案并没有我以为的那样了结。"

# game/case11.rpy:253
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_2dfa6ed8:

    # komachi "Got it. The boss's docket. Every verdict, in her handwriting."
    komachi "找到了。四季大人的案卷。每个判决都是她的笔迹。"

# game/case11.rpy:255
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_3b4c174c:

    # eiki "All of them. Including the ones that don't photograph well."
    eiki "全部都在。包括那些不上镜的。"

# game/case11.rpy:259
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_51fb778d:

    # aya "No comment! ...Okay, one comment. The photo never lies."
    aya "无可奉告！……好吧，就一句。照片不会说谎。"

# game/case11.rpy:265
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_12e5bd7d:

    # komachi "She's back, Junior Judge. With a newspaper the size of a door."
    komachi "她回来了，见习法官。抱着一份门板那么大的报纸。"

# game/case11.rpy:279
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_60fc3962:

    # aya_t "Here are this court's verdicts, as printed in today's Bunbunmaru."
    aya_t "这就是本庭的判决，如今天的文文。新闻所刊。"

# game/case11.rpy:280
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_4b97ac0f:

    # aya_t "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu, Kaguya: guilty, every one. This court convicts everyone!"
    aya_t "琪露诺、魔理沙、铃仙、美铃、爱丽丝、灵梦、辉夜：全部有罪。这个法庭给所有人定罪！"

# game/case11.rpy:281
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_96b863dc:

    # aya_t "The photo never lies. Every verdict I printed is real."
    aya_t "照片不会说谎。我刊登的每个判决都是真的。"

# game/case11.rpy:285
translate schinese case11_recess_menu_41a98a18:

    # komachi "Your witness, Junior Judge. Slower this time, at least."
    komachi "证人交给你了，见习法官。至少这次慢一点。"

# game/case11.rpy:299
translate schinese case11_cross2_da3256d2:

    # komachi "Again, Junior Judge. Her headline isn't going anywhere."
    komachi "再来一次，见习法官。她的标题跑不了。"

# game/case11.rpy:310
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_d79ef59c:

    # you "Your headline prints seven guilty verdicts. This docket has ten cases. You left out every acquittal."
    you "你的标题印了七个有罪判决。这份案卷有十件案子。你漏掉了每一个无罪判决。"

# game/case11.rpy:311
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_c07305d6:

    # you "Meiling, not guilty. Mokou, not guilty. Your film roll has their photos. You just didn't print them."
    you "美铃，无罪。妹红，无罪。你的胶卷里有她们的照片。你只是没印出来。"

# game/case11.rpy:314
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_3d439e70:

    # aya "...They weren't exciting! Nobody buys a paper that says \"Court Mostly Fair\"!"
    aya "……那些不够刺激！谁会买一份写着“法庭大体公正”的报纸啊！"

# game/case11.rpy:317
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_d0658fd1:

    # komachi "Cherry picking, Junior Judge. Pick the ripe ones, hide the rest."
    komachi "选择性举证，见习法官。只摘熟的，把其余的藏起来。"

# game/case11.rpy:318
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_8af5fb42:

    # eiki "A handful of true facts, chosen to tell a false story. That is still a lie, Miss Shameimaru."
    eiki "挑出一把真事实，去讲一个假故事。那仍然是谎言，射命丸小姐。"

# game/case11.rpy:323
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_d2fa6eb7:

    # you "In the matter of Bunbunmaru News against the Higan Court, this court finds the defendant..."
    you "就文文。新闻诉彼岸法庭一案，本庭判决被告……"

# game/case11.rpy:334
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_b8f946c5:

    # eiki "Thank you, Junior Judge. And now, a separate matter. Komachi, the parasol."
    eiki "谢谢你，见习法官。那么，另一件事。小町，阳伞。"

# game/case11.rpy:335
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_7c22679f:

    # komachi "From her props cupboard, boss."
    komachi "从她的道具柜里找到的，四季大人。"

# game/case11.rpy:339
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_8928ec58:

    # aya "Borrowed! For a photo shoot! I left a note!"
    aya "只是借用！为了拍照！我还留了字条！"

# game/case11.rpy:341
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_c00ee2c5:

    # eiki "Signed \"A.S.\" I remember. Case 06 is reopened. Bailiff."
    eiki "署名“A.S.”。我记得。第六案重新开庭。法警。"

# game/case11.rpy:342
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case11.rpy:355
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_b6141252:

    # komachi "...She's gone, boss. Before I even swung."
    komachi "……她不见了，四季大人。我还没出手呢。"

# game/case11.rpy:356
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_f87aad9d:

    # aya "Got the shot! \"Bailiff Misses!\" Front page tomorrow!"
    aya "拍到了！“法警扑空！”明天的头版！"

# game/case11.rpy:363
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_343c4fc9:

    # sakuya "I'll take the parasol, thank you. And the tengu. She's in my other hand."
    sakuya "阳伞我收下了，谢谢。还有这个天狗。她在我另一只手里。"

# game/case11.rpy:364
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_4d7f3a72:

    # aya "How did she— I'm the fastest in—"
    aya "她怎么——我可是幻想乡最快的——"

# game/case11.rpy:365
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_6e014feb:

    # sakuya "You are. I simply don't use time the way you do."
    sakuya "你是。我只是用时间的方式和你不同。"

# game/case11.rpy:375
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_3ed88655:

    # komachi "...She does that."
    komachi "……她常这样。"

# game/case11.rpy:376
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_4e264560:

    # eiki "Eleven cases, Junior Judge."
    eiki "十一件案子，见习法官。"

# game/case11.rpy:377
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_b9f55d4d:

    # eiki "You caught every fallacy on this docket. And twice, you found the truth behind a bad argument."
    eiki "你识破了这份案卷里的每一个谬误。还有两次，你在糟糕的论证背后找到了真相。"

# game/case11.rpy:378
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_71bf8c82:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Your work was... more than acceptable."
    eiki "见习法官。你的表现……不止及格。"

# game/case11.rpy:379
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_42d7cba4:

    # komachi "She's never said that before. Not once."
    komachi "她以前从没这么说过。一次都没有。"

# game/case11.rpy:380
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case11.rpy:381
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_bd395515:

    # komachi "Escorting myself out."
    komachi "我把自己护送出去。"

# game/case11.rpy:382
translate schinese case11_breakthrough_3d82d9a4:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned."
    eiki "退庭。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case11.rpy:14
    old "Bunbunmaru, Today's Edition"
    new "文文。新闻，今日版"

    # game/case11.rpy:14
    old "\"HIGAN COURT FINDS EVERYONE GUILTY!\" Seven verdicts. Seven photos."
    new "“彼岸法庭判所有人有罪！”七个判决。七张照片。"

    # game/case11.rpy:16
    old "The Court's Own Docket"
    new "法庭自己的案卷"

    # game/case11.rpy:16
    old "Every verdict, Cases 01 to 10, in Eiki's own hand. Some of them say NOT GUILTY."
    new "第一案到第十案的全部判决，映姬亲笔。其中有些写着“无罪”。"

    # game/case11.rpy:18
    old "Aya's Film Roll"
    new "文的胶卷"

    # game/case11.rpy:18
    old "Thirty-six frames. Seven printed. The rest: acquittals, a parasol, a sleeping gatekeeper."
    new "三十六张底片。印出来的有七张。其余的：无罪判决、一把阳伞、一个睡着的门卫。"

    # game/case11.rpy:20
    old "The Mistress's Parasol"
    new "大小姐的阳伞"

    # game/case11.rpy:20
    old "From the Bunbunmaru props cupboard. Missing since Case 06."
    new "出自文文。新闻的道具柜。自第六案起下落不明。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "What the Defendants Say"
    new "被告们怎么说"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Aya Shameimaru, Bunbunmaru News. Fastest reporter in Gensokyo. I've covered every case in this court."
    new "射命丸文，文文。新闻。幻想乡最快的记者。本庭的每一件案子我都报道过。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Introductions aren't arguments, Junior Judge. Even fast ones."
    new "自我介绍不是论证，见习法官。再快也不是。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "I interviewed seven of your defendants. Every one of them says this court is unfair."
    new "我采访了你们的七名被告。每个人都说本庭不公平。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "That's what she was told. Object to what she makes of it."
    new "那是她听到的话。反对她从中得出的东西。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Seven defendants can't all be wrong. The Higan Court is unfair."
    new "七名被告不可能都错。彼岸法庭不公平。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Maybe later. Right now she isn't hiding anything. She's leaning on a headcount."
    new "以后也许是。现在她什么都没隐瞒。她靠的是人数。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "No expert here, Junior Judge. Just seven unhappy voices, counted as proof."
    new "这里没有专家，见习法官。只是七个不满的声音被当成了证据。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "She has seven examples, not one. The trouble is she counts votes instead of checking verdicts."
    new "她有七个例子，不是一个。问题在于她数的是票，而没去核对判决。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "She isn't attacking the boss. She's counting complaints."
    new "她没有攻击四季大人。她是在数抱怨。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "The Photo Never Lies"
    new "照片不会说谎"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Here are this court's verdicts, as printed in today's Bunbunmaru."
    new "这就是本庭的判决，如今天的文文。新闻所刊。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "A newspaper is a fact, Junior Judge. What she prints in it is the question."
    new "报纸是事实，见习法官。问题在于她在上面印了什么。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu, Kaguya: guilty, every one. This court convicts everyone!"
    new "琪露诺、魔理沙、铃仙、美铃、爱丽丝、灵梦、辉夜：全部有罪。这个法庭给所有人定罪！"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "The photo never lies. Every verdict I printed is real."
    new "照片不会说谎。我刊登的每个判决都是真的。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "She's right. Every verdict she printed is real. The trouble is the ones she didn't print."
    new "她说得对。她刊登的判决都是真的。问题在于她没刊登的那些。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Close. But she has more examples than she shows. She picked the ones that fit."
    new "接近了。但她手上的例子比她展示的多。她挑了合适的那些。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Not a crowd this time. A selection. Ask what she left out."
    new "这次不是人群。是挑选。问问她漏掉了什么。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Nobody's words are twisted. The verdicts are real. Just not all of them."
    new "没有人的话被歪曲。判决都是真的。只是不全。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Nothing's mistaken for a cause. Something's missing from the list."
    new "没有把什么误当成原因。是清单里少了东西。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "She isn't citing an expert. She's choosing her evidence."
    new "她没有援引专家。她在挑选证据。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "That doesn't show what her headline left out. Find the court's full record."
